text.en:
Section 4 of the Act is amended -

(a) in the marginal note, by deleting "of licences revocation" and by suspension or revocation of licences" therefor;

(b) in subsection [ 1). by deleting "of this section" from the first two lines and by substituting "and section 4A,";

(c) in subsection (2), by inserting "suspend or" immediately before "revoke" in the first line;

(d) by deleting subsection (3) and by substituting the following new therefor "[3) Any person who is aggrieved by the refusal of the licensing to grant a licence or by a decision of the licensing authority to or revoke a licence may, within 14 days of the date of receipt of the notice of such refusal, suspension or revocation, appeal in to the Minister, whose decision shall be final.". of section 4A.
